The student wants to explain the purpose of the vault.$q$,$q$Which choice most effectively uses relevant information from the notes to accomplish this goal?$q$,$j$["The Svalbard Global Seed Vault stores duplicate seed samples to protect the world's crop diversity in case of disaster.","More than one million seed samples are stored in the Svalbard Global Seed Vault.","The Svalbard Global Seed Vault is located in Norway.","The Svalbard Global Seed Vault is built inside a mountain on an Arctic island."]$j$::jsonb,0,$q$Only this choice states what the vault is for: protecting crop diversity in case of disaster.$q$,$j${"1":"This gives the size of the collection, not its purpose."}$j$::jsonb,71,'Original ScoreSpring practice content (AI-drafted; answer keys checked)','ai_generated','approved'),
('5b020000-0000-4000-8000-000000000053','SAT',$q$Reading and Writing$q$,'sat-expression-ideas',2,$q$While researching a topic, a student has taken the following notes:
