('5b020000-0000-4000-8000-000000000061','SAT',$q$Reading and Writing$q$,'sat-expression-ideas',2,$q$The town council approved the new park in 2019. Construction was delayed, ______ by a shortage of materials and then by an unusually wet spring.$q$,$q$Which choice completes the text with the most logical transition?$q$,$j$["instead","finally","meanwhile","first"]$j$::jsonb,3,$q$"First … and then" presents the two causes of delay in sequence.$q$,$j${}$j$::jsonb,71,'Original ScoreSpring practice content (AI-drafted; answer keys checked)','ai_generated','approved'),
